        }
      }
    },
    "Free includes daily capture, the recent archive, and a 5-person Circle. Pro opens the full archive, month view, an unlimited Circle, together cards, and weekly recaps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free includes daily capture, the recent archive, and a 5-person Circle. Pro opens the full archive, month view, an unlimited Circle, together cards, and weekly recaps."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無料版には毎日の撮影、直近のアーカイブ、5人までのサークルが含まれるよ。Proでは全アーカイブ、月表示、無制限のサークル、トゥギャザーカード、ウィークリーリキャップが解禁されるよ。"
          }
